  "description_short": "Laid-back café in Plett serving hearty breakfasts, fresh smoothies, and ocean-view vibes near the beach.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Anchor Crescent, Seakrit Spot lives up to its name as a hidden gem just a stone's throw from Plettenberg Bay's stunning coastline. This relaxed café has become a favourite among locals and visitors alike for its welcoming atmosphere and honest, wholesome food that doesn't try too hard.\n\nThe menu leans into all-day breakfasts and fresh café fare — think generous omelettes, açai bowls, toasted sandwiches, and proper coffee. Their smoothies and fresh juices are a hit on warm days, and the vibe is easygoing enough for sandy feet and salty hair. With its proximity to the beach and a reputation built on consistent quality rather than flash, it's the kind of spot you'll want to return to morning after morning.\n\nWhether you're fuelling up before a coastal walk or settling in with a book and a flat white, Seakrit Spot delivers that effortless Plett beach-town feel without pretension.",
